# HARD.P0-12 — H12: fix the docker-compose quickstart

## Fixes

- Dockerfile: the runtime image now builds and carries /mockupstream (the
  compose mockupstream service referenced a binary the image did not have).
- examples/docker-compose/docker-compose.yml: every service used `command:`
  against an image whose ENTRYPOINT is /restitch, so docker ran
  `/restitch /mockupstream ...`, `/restitch run ...` with a doubled prefix
  and `/restitch /restitch-studio ...` — all three exited 2. Per-service
  `entrypoint:` now selects the right binary (the deploy-stack pattern).
- C2/C3 consequences in the same file: gateway admin binds 0.0.0.0 with a
  required key (RESTITCH_ADMIN_BIND/RESTITCH_ADMIN_API_KEY); Studio binds
  0.0.0.0 (STUDIO_BIND) and proxies with STUDIO_ADMIN_KEY.
- examples/docker-compose/README.md admin curls now send X-Admin-Key.

## Verification (docker compose -f examples/docker-compose/docker-compose.yml up)

docker-compose-mockupstream-1   "/mockupstream -port…"   Up
docker-compose-restitch-1       "/restitch run -conf…"   Up
docker-compose-restitch-studio-1 "/restitch-studio -p…"  Up

$ curl -s "http://localhost:8080/api/users/42/dashboard" | python3 -m json.tool
{
    "orders": [...],
    "user": {...}
}  -> 200 composed response

metrics: 43 restitch_ families on http://localhost:9090/metrics
admin keyed:   200
admin no key:  401
studio SPA:    200
stack torn down cleanly afterwards (docker compose down -v)
